{"header":{"status":{"name":"Success","code":0,"description":"Query success","apiHelp":"https://www.censtatd.gov.hk/tc/web_table.html?id=315-37003&api_popup=1"},"title":"國際收支平衡：經常賬戶及資本賬戶","tablenote":["由於數字經四捨五入，分項總和未必與總數相等。     在經常賬戶中，貨物及服務的輸出和初次及二次收入的流入均屬貸方記賬，而借方記賬是指貨物及服務的輸入和初次及二次收入的流出。在資本賬戶中，收取資本轉移屬貸方記賬，支付資本轉移則屬借方記賬。經常賬戶或資本賬戶的差額為貸方記賬減去借方記賬，差額為正數值代表盈餘，而負數值則代表赤字。","[*3] 由於數值較不顯著及／或為使個別機構單位所提供的資料得以保密，數字不予公布。","@ 數字在日後會作出修訂。"],"source":"政府統計處國際收支平衡統計科 (一)  (查詢電話：3863 2329  查詢電郵：bop@censtatd.gov.hk)","count":{"noOfRecords":246,"started":"2026-10-20T20:02:02+00:00","finished":"2026-10-20T20:02:03+00:00","durationSeconds":0.653878}},"dataSet":[{"BOP_COMPONENT":"CEC","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"僱員報酬","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":1190,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"CED","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"僱員報酬","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":1357,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"CPA","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"資本賬戶","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":-38,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"CPAC","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"貸方","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":18,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"CPAD","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"借方","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":56,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"CRA","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"經常賬戶","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":22226,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"CRAC","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"貸方","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":1811897,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"CRAD","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"借方","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":1789672,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DIDIInvIncC","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"股息和準公司收益提取","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":67847,"sd_value":""},{"BOP_COMPONENT":"DIDIInvIncD","BOP_COMPONENTDesc":"股息和準公司收益提取","freq":"Y","period":"1998","sv":"BOP","svDesc":"百萬港元","figure":85772,"sd_value